WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.750
Ask stronger questions at the end. Use the closing minutes to understand expectations, team priorities, and the next step in the process.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.500
Question 1. What does success look like?. Ask what a strong first ninety days or first year would look like in this role.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Question 2. What needs attention now?. Learn which project, problem, or team priority will matter most when you arrive.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.000
Question 3. How does the team work?. Ask how decisions, feedback, and collaboration usually happen day to day.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.750
Question 4. Is anything unclear?. Invite the interviewer to raise a concern you can address before the conversation ends.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.500
Close well. Confirm the next step. Thank them, restate your interest, and ask what timing you should expect.
